  "body_html": "<p>Marsk, dit Mandskab tæller som udgangspunkt et halvt dusin. Behandl dem som en følgesvend med mærkatet <em>gruppe</em> . Alle startværdier her kan ændre sig undervejs i spillet.</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"crew\" data-hp-key=\"crew\" data-label=\"Crew\">\n<h2 id=\"the-crew\">Mandskabet</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"Maks. HP\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Maks. HP</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Rustning\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Rustning</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"Skade\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"Slå skade\">Skade</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<p class=\"fs-gloss\">HP begynder på 6 hver; Rustning på 0; Skade på d6.</p>\n<h3 id=\"tags\">Mærkater</h3>\n<p>Dit mandskab begynder med <em>gruppe</em>, et mærkat fra din baggrund, plus 2 mere efter eget valg.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag0\" data-check-id=\"tag0\"> <span><em>bueskytter</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag1\" data-check-id=\"tag1\"> <span><em>atletiske</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag2\" data-check-id=\"tag2\"> <span><em>tapre</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag3\" data-check-id=\"tag3\"> <span><em>snu</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag4\" data-check-id=\"tag4\"> <span><em>hengivne</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled aria-label=\"Begynder afkrydset\"> <span><em>gruppe</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag6\" data-check-id=\"tag6\"> <span><em>hårdføre</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag7\" data-check-id=\"tag7\"> <span><em>skræmmende</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag8\" data-check-id=\"tag8\"> <span><em>opmærksomme</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag9\" data-check-id=\"tag9\"> <span><em>tålmodige</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag10\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag10\" data-check-id=\"tag10\"> <span><em>respekterede</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag11\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag11\" data-check-id=\"tag11\"> <span><em>snigende</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag12\" data-check-id=\"tag12\"> <span><em>krigere</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank0\" data-check-id=\"tagblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"eget forslag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank1\" data-check-id=\"tagblank1\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank1\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"eget forslag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank2\" data-check-id=\"tagblank2\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank2\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"eget forslag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"exc0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"exc0\" data-check-id=\"exc0\"> <span><em>enestående</em> (kræver Helte til det Sidste)</span></label></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"instinct\">Instinkt</h3>\n<p>Vælg 1.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst0\" data-check-id=\"inst0\"> <span>At mundhugges, strides indbyrdes og bære nag</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst1\" data-check-id=\"inst1\"> <span>At holde på tradition og overtro</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst2\" data-check-id=\"inst2\"> <span>At give efter for deres lavere instinkter</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst3\" data-check-id=\"inst3\"> <span>At herse med andre</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst4\" data-check-id=\"inst4\"> <span>At løbe unødige risici</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst5\" data-check-id=\"inst5\"> <span>At gå for vidt</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"instblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"instblank0\" data-check-id=\"instblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:instblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"eget forslag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"cost\">Pris</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><p>Vælg 1.</p><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"crew-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">Loyalitet</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-0\" title=\"Loyalitet 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"Loyalitet 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-1\" title=\"Loyalitet 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"Loyalitet 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-2\" title=\"Loyalitet 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"Loyalitet 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost0\" data-check-id=\"cost0\"> <span>Lystighed, i samlet flok</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost1\" data-check-id=\"cost1\"> <span>Offentlig anerkendelse og respekt, ære</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost2\" data-check-id=\"cost2\"> <span>Risici løbet, af dig, for at hjælpe dem</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost3\" data-check-id=\"cost3\"> <span>Sejre vundet over værdige fjender</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost4\" data-check-id=\"cost4\"> <span>Rigdom vundet til dem selv eller Stonetop</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"costblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"costblank0\" data-check-id=\"costblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:costblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"eget forslag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"inventory\">Oppakning</h3>\n<p>3 ◇ eller færre er let byrde; 4–6 ◇ er normal byrde; 7–9 ◇ er tung byrde.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-inventory\"><li>◇ <strong>Økse</strong>, jern (<em>hånd</em>, <em>kastevåben</em>, x gennemborende)</li><li>◇ <strong>Spyd</strong>, jern (<em>tæt</em>, <em>kastevåben</em>, x gennemborende)</li><li>◇ <strong>Bue &amp; jernpile</strong> (<em>nær</em>, x gennemborende, ○ få pile, ○ ikke flere pile)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Skjold</strong> (+1 rustning, +1 Beredskab på 7+ ved Forsvar)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Tykke huder</strong> (1 rustning, <em>varm</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Kappe</strong> (<em>varm</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Forsyninger</strong> (4+Velstand anvendelser pr. mand)</li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-a-\"><span class=\"track-label\">Forsyninger</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" title=\"Anvendelse 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" title=\"Anvendelse 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" title=\"Anvendelse 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" title=\"Anvendelse 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" title=\"Anvendelse 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" title=\"Anvendelse 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" title=\"Anvendelse 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" title=\"Anvendelse 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-b-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" title=\"Anvendelse 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" title=\"Anvendelse 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" title=\"Anvendelse 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" title=\"Anvendelse 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" title=\"Anvendelse 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" title=\"Anvendelse 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" title=\"Anvendelse 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" title=\"Anvendelse 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-c-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" title=\"Anvendelse 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" title=\"Anvendelse 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" title=\"Anvendelse 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" title=\"Anvendelse 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" title=\"Anvendelse 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" title=\"Anvendelse 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" title=\"Anvendelse 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" title=\"Anvendelse 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" aria-label=\"Anvendelse 8\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Andet udstyr</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<h3 id=\"individuals\">Enkeltpersoner</h3>\n<p>Når én skiller sig ud, så giv vedkommende et navn, et mærkat og et eller flere kendetegn.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-people\"><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Navn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"navn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Mærkat</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"mærkat\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kendetegn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"kendetegn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Navn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"navn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Mærkat</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"mærkat\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kendetegn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"kendetegn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Navn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"navn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Mærkat</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"mærkat\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kendetegn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"kendetegn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Navn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"navn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Mærkat</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"mærkat\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kendetegn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"kendetegn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Navn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"navn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Mærkat</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"mærkat\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kendetegn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"kendetegn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Navn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"navn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Mærkat</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"mærkat\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kendetegn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"kendetegn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>Navne:</strong> Aled, Culhwich, Eira, Gerat, Glaw, Harri, Lowri, Mervyn, Nesta</p>\n<p><strong>Mærkater:</strong> <em>dyreven, stor, bølle, kynisk, drukkenbolt, ivrig, spillefugl, grådig, gnaven, godtroende, hjerteknuser, ærlig, venlig, sjofel, lille, naiv, gammel, vellidt, stolt, grønskolling, dumdristig, skamløs, skarpøjet, hidsig</em></p>\n<p><strong>Kendetegn:</strong> ___s barn/søskende/forælder/fætter/___, skaldet, forelsket i ___, nag til ___, hader ___, forguder ___, laver sjov, rodet, mangler øje/finger/hånd/___, savner sine børn, mareridt, nygift, from, ar, radmager, skarp tunge, synger, snorker, fortæller røverhistorier, for alvorlig, kvaler derhjemme, fløjter, snitter</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Noter</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"Noter\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"order-followers\">Befal Følgesvende</h3>\n<p>Når du <strong><em>befaler dem at gøre et træk, og de gør det</em></strong>, slå +1 i stedet for +EGENSKAB, hvis nogen af deres mærkater gælder (eller +2, hvis de tilmed er <em>enestående</em>). Gælder ingen mærkater, slå +0. Ville nogen af deres mærkater stå i vejen, slå med ulempe.</p>\n<p>Når de er <strong><em>uden ordrer</em></strong> , eller de <strong><em>handler på eget initiativ</em></strong>, siger spillederen, hvad de gør, og hvordan det går.</p>\n<h3 id=\"strengthen-your-bond\">Styrk Jeres Bånd</h3>\n<p>Når du <strong><em>betaler deres pris</em></strong> , og du ikke har gjort det for nylig, holder de +1 Loyalitet (højst 3).</p>\n<p>Brug deres Loyalitet 1 for 1 til at få dem til at:</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Overvinde deres frygt og gøre, som du siger</li><li>Lade være med at handle efter deres instinkt/mærkater/træk</li><li>Gøre noget, de ikke vil (så længe det ikke er afskyeligt eller selvmorderisk)</li></ul>"
}
